  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-168842638426899e3410/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>Michael Rudden</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2025-05-29T13:00:00-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, May 29, 2025, 1:00 pm\">May 29, 2025</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"em em-view-container\" id=\"em-view-6\">\n\t<div class=\"em pixelbones em-item em-item-single em-event em-event-single em-event-349 \" id=\"em-event-6\">\n\t\t<div></div>\n<p>\n\t<strong>Date/Time</strong><br />\n\tDate(s) - 05/29/2025<br /><i>1:00 pm - 3:30 pm</i>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<strong>Location</strong><br />\n\t<a href=\"/archive/source-721369e26986a1f1a316/\">Harwich Community Center</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<strong>Categories</strong>\n\t\t</p><ul class=\"event-categories\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/archive/source-b5a8fd6245d54271c682/\">Thursday Open Paint</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\n<p></p>\n<br />\n<p>Guild members gather each Thursday in the Harwich Community Center from 1-3:30pm  to either paint what they are individually working on</p>\n<p></p><figure id=\"attachment_6798\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-6798\" src=\"/media/archive/8a012ed4bcdf24877389996bf53e7847c05203f91a3c27a451d0192d5a916f7f.jpg\" alt=\"Guild members assemble miniature holiday ornaments sold to raise monies for local children's charities.\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" loading=\"lazy\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-6798\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Guild members assemble miniature holiday ornaments sold to raise monies for local children’s charities.</figcaption></figure><p></p>\n<p>or work together to prepare for an upcoming event.  Members of the public are invited to join them by bringing your painting supplies and subject.</p>\n\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
